      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514651::chunk::003::results_and_discussion::745175bfb4"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The operative microstructural mechanism is dendrite dissolution and formation of L1_2-ordered precipitates.",
